<title>USA: U.S. DAP and ammonia prices mostly steady.</title>
<headline>U.S. DAP and ammonia prices mostly steady.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-06-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices for diammonium phosphate were mostly steady on Friday. &quot;The market still remains stable. Volume of export sales, mostly to China, continued to dominate the market, a dealer said.</p>
<p>			     Dlrs/short ton   Chg from Wednesday</p>
<p>DAP central Fla		172-174		 unc</p>
<p>DAP central La Gulf	  185-187		 dn 1</p>
<p>Ammonia/La Gulf		160-165		 unc</p>
<p>(na - not available, nc - no comparison)</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720))</p>
